{
    "title": "Rhythm Racer Music Go",
    "description": "Welcome to Rhythm Racer Music Go, let\u2019s race & rhythm! Control your super car to catch the beat.\r\n\r\nRecent update!! \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udfb6More new popular songs incoming, Pop, Hip Hop, Kpop, Rock, Jazz and EDM.\ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udfb6\r\n\r\nLet's feel the beat in this music game songs from top singers like Imagine Dragons, Alan Walker, Blackpink & BTS etc.\ud83d\ude0d\r\n\r\n\r\n\u3010Easy to play\u3011\r\n- Hold and Drag the car to catch the rhythm.\r\n- Do Not Miss Any Rhythms.\r\n- Follow the rhythm of addictive challenges.\r\n- Impress your friends with your perfect combos.\r\n\r\n\u3010Game Offers\u3011\r\n- Easy & Simple Game Control Experiences!\r\n- Fantastic Gameplay\r\n- Amounts of Songs to Satisfy All Your Taste (100+ Songs will be updated)!\r\n- Greatest Supercars, Your Dream Cars all in this game!\r\n- Supercars with it\u2019s custom design\r\n\r\n\r\nIf any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send email to us and it will be deleted immediately if necessary (this includes the images used).",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Rhythm Racer Music Go, let\u2019s race &amp; rhythm! Control your super car to catch the beat.<br><br>Recent update!! \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udfb6More new popular songs incoming, Pop, Hip Hop, Kpop, Rock, Jazz and EDM.\ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udfb6<br><br>Let&#39;s feel the beat in this music game songs from top singers like Imagine Dragons, Alan Walker, Blackpink &amp; BTS etc.\ud83d\ude0d<br><br><br>\u3010Easy to play\u3011<br>- Hold and Drag the car to catch the rhythm.<br>- Do Not Miss Any Rhythms.<br>- Follow the rhythm of addictive challenges.<br>- Impress your friends with your perfect combos.<br><br>\u3010Game Offers\u3011<br>- Easy &amp; Simple Game Control Experiences!<br>- Fantastic Gameplay<br>- Amounts of Songs to Satisfy All Your Taste (100+ Songs will be updated)!<br>- Greatest Supercars, Your Dream Cars all in this game!<br>- Supercars with it\u2019s custom design<br><br><br>If any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send email to us and it will be deleted immediately if necessary (this includes the images used).",
